================================================================================
A note on codec patents
================================================================================

HEVC / H.265, which compVDO produces by default, is covered by patents
administered by several licensing pools. Apache-2.0's patent grant covers this
project's own contributions; it cannot and does not grant rights to third-party
codec patents.

On Android the encoding is performed by the device's own licensed hardware
encoder. On desktop it is performed by whichever FFmpeg the user installed.
This project ships no codec. If you intend to distribute compVDO commercially
or at scale, take your own advice on this — nothing here is legal advice.
